{"title":"Sand Wyrm","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 48 Sand Wyrm that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sand-wyrm\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sand-wyrm?lv=47\">Lv 47 <span>13</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sand-wyrm?lv=48\">Lv 48 <span>13</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/sand-wyrm?lv=49\">Lv 49 <span>6</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sand-wyrm?lv=50\">Lv 50 <span>4</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/sand-wyrm?lv=47\" title=\"Pick level 47\"><td><b>47</b></td><td>266</td><td>30.4</td><td>2,350</td><td class=\"muted\">798 · 42.6 · 7,050</td><td>13</td><td>in the wilds around 1997, 908</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/sand-wyrm?lv=48\" title=\"Pick level 48\"><td><b>48</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>278</td><td>30.9</td><td>2,400</td><td class=\"muted\">834 · 43.3 · 7,200</td><td>13</td><td>in the wilds around 1998, 898</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/sand-wyrm\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>49</b></td><td>290</td><td>31.5</td><td>2,450</td><td class=\"muted\">870 · 44.1 · 7,350</td><td>6</td><td>in the wilds around 2076, 890</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/sand-wyrm?lv=50\" title=\"Pick level 50\"><td><b>50</b></td><td>303</td><td>32</td><td>2,500</td><td class=\"muted\">909 · 44.8 · 7,500</td><td>4</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Maw's%20Sands\">Old Maw&#39;s Sands</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"sand-wyrm\" data-map-level=\"49\">Show level 49 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 1 recorded drop, 160 total, 160 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 2070, 900 <span class=\"muted\">· 14 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 1997, 903 <span class=\"muted\">· 14 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 1897, 1043 <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 2221, 954 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Maw's%20Sands\">Old Maw&#39;s Sands</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"sand-wyrm\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/old-maw\"><img src=\"data/img/da25370d9ff1caef2f04.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Old Maw</b><span>Lv 50</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Sand Wyrm: <a href=\"#/monster/sand-wyrmling\">Sand Wyrmling</a> <span class=\"muted\">(44)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/4899a87aa36806541c7d.webp\" alt=\"Sand Wyrm\"></div><h3>Sand Wyrm</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>49</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 48)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Sand Wyrm</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>290</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>31.5</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2,450</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.8 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.8</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>37 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}